<title>FRANCE: Bank of France hopeful on growth prospects.</title>
<headline>Bank of France hopeful on growth prospects.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank France says in its June report that latest economic findings made it hopeful about the country's growth outlook.</p>
<p>&quot;The latest statistics we have allow us to make a favorable assessment about the outlook for growth,&quot; the independent central bank said in the monthly report.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
